STR_GRF_NAME					:HVW Bus Set
STR_GRF_DESC					:{}{LTBLUE}Bus Set{BLACK}{}{}If you’re playing with a version older than OpenTTD 15.0‑beta2, switch {RED}OFF{BLACK} the Badge parameter to avoid an error.{}If you want to play with badges, it’s recommended to also add the {GOLD}PeterN's Default Badge Set{BLACK} GRF for the best gameplay experience.{}{}{BLACK}Code and model:{GREEN}SosMakaroni{} {COPYRIGHT}2026 SosMakaroni{}{GRAY}License: GPLv2{}{BLACK}Ver.377 2026.04.26.

